 q: [["The tower is as high as a building with 10 floors.",true],["The khan wanted to marry his own daughter.",true],["The work on the tower went very slowly.",false],["The girl went up to the top with her father.",false],["An investigation has shown which story is true.",false],["Many people visit the tower every year.",true]],
